\\mathrm{DefProg}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c234c1cfaaa63dac\" href=\"?note=c234c1cfaaa63dac\" title=\"57-df-definite-program\">57-df-definite-program</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SLD}}A\\sigma\">\\(P\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SLD}}A\\sigma\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"43bf0ac6633013d5\" href=\"?note=43bf0ac6633013d5\" title=\"57-df-sld-resolution\">57-df-sld-resolution</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundSubst}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundSubst}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"084b8299a8fe4c6c\" href=\"?note=084b8299a8fe4c6c\" title=\"57-df-ground-substitution\">57-df-ground-substitution</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a>。本文件保持原本“没有成功的基实例反驳”的语义定义，不改为某一具体搜索策略的有限失败。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NAF}\">\\(\\mathrm{NAF}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NAF}(P,A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{GroundSubst}_S\\;\n[\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\land P\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SLD}}A\\sigma].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NAF}(P,A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{GroundSubst}_S\\;\n[\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\land P\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SLD}}A\\sigma].\\]</div><button class=